{"id":"952055ea38b3b9ae","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-cor-sierpinski.md","title":"Sierpiński Corollary","display":"cor-sierpinski — Sierpiński Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-sierpinski","aliases":["58-cor-sierpinski"],"display":"cor-sierpinski — Sierpiński Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-null-set.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ch.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-sierpinski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-sierpinski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-sierpinski — Sierpiński Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"990e93a33f4633db\" href=\"?note=990e93a33f4633db\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-null-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-null-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8e91517c28976b8\" href=\"?note=a8e91517c28976b8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ch.md\">../batch14/58-df-ch.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}_S\\)</span> (连续统假设, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a8e91517c28976b8\" href=\"?note=a8e91517c28976b8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ch.md\">../batch14/58-df-ch.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NullSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NullSet}_S\\)</span> (零测集谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"990e93a33f4633db\" href=\"?note=990e93a33f4633db\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-null-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-null-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> (可数集谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}sierpinski} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}_S\\land\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(|S|=\\mathfrak c\\land\n\\forall N\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n(\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,m,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(S\\cap N))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}sierpinski} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}_S\\land\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(|S|=\\mathfrak c\\land\n\\forall N\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n(\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,m,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(S\\cap N))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sierpiński sets are dual to Lusin sets under measure/category duality.</li>\n<li>CH 足以构造 Sierpiński 集；原断言漏掉存在量词和 CH 前提。</li>\n<li>此处的 Sierpiński 集与同名的 Sierpiński gasket 分形无关。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-null-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"990e93a33f4633db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-null-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ch.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8e91517c28976b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ch.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ch.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8e91517c28976b8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CH}_S$ (连续统假设, see [[../batch14/58-df-ch.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-null-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"990e93a33f4633db","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NullSet}_S$ (零测集谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-null-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Countable}_S$ (可数集谓词, see [[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CH}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NullSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}sierpinski} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}_S\\land\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(|S|=\\mathfrak c\\land\n\\forall N\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n(\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,m,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\mathrm{Countable}_S(S\\cap N))\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1281,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-cor-sierpinski.md|58-cor-sierpinski]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["990e93a33f4633db","1b3610e6aed65b25","a8e91517c28976b8","68427bc628af9b8d"]}